       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.             SPMFIXDT.
       INSTALLATION.           GOODYEAR TIRE & RUBBER CO.
      *REMARKS.                PREVENTIVE MAINTENANCE FIXED-DATE
      *                        AND CALENDAR RELEASE PROGRAMS.
      *                        UPDATE CALENDAR SCHEDULES PROGRAM.
      *                        ****.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.        IBM-AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.        IBM-AS400.

       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT PM-SCHEDULE
                  ASSIGN       TO DATABASE-MCFLMM4402
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS MODE  IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY   IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                               WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS  IS FILE-STAT.

           SELECT DISPLAY-FILE
                  ASSIGN       TO WORKSTATION-ZPMMAINT-SI
                  ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
                  ACCESS MODE  IS SEQUENTIAL
                  FILE STATUS  IS SCREEN-STATUS
                               MAJOR-MINOR
                  CONTROL-AREA IS SCREEN-CONTROL.

       DATA DIVISION.
        FILE SECTION.
        FD  PM-SCHEDULE
            LABEL RECORDS      ARE STANDARD.
        01  PM-SCHED-REC.
            COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLMM4402.

        FD  DISPLAY-FILE
            LABEL RECORDS      ARE OMITTED.
        01  DISPLAY-REC        PIC X(2000).

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       77  TRUE-VAL            PIC 1      VALUE B"1".
       77  SUB                 PIC 9(04)  VALUE 0 COMP.
       77  R-CTR               PIC 9(04)  VALUE 0 COMP.
       77  HELP-SW             PIC 9(04)  VALUE 0.
       77  SAVE-DATA           PIC X(06)  VALUE SPACES.
       77  MO-NAME             PIC X(09)  VALUE SPACES.
       77  RET-CODE            PIC XX     VALUE "0 ".
       77  MO-ERROR            PIC X(76)  VALUE SPACES.
       77  MARK                PIC X.
       77  ANSWER-FIELD        PIC X.

       01  FILE-STAT.
           05 FILE-STAT-1      PIC X   VALUE "0".
           05 FILE-STAT-2      PIC X   VALUE "0".

       01  CURR-DATE.
           05  CD-YY           PIC 99.
           05  CD-MM           PIC 99.
           05  CD-DD           PIC 99.

       01  TODAYS-DATE.
           05  TD-YEARMO.
               10  TD-CT       PIC 99.
               10  TD-YY       PIC 99.
               10  TD-MM       PIC 99.
           05  TD-DD           PIC 99.

       01  SAVE-FIELDS.
           05  W-SAVE.
               10  W-SAVE1     PIC X.
               10  W-SAVE2     PIC X.
           05  W-SAVE-9        REDEFINES W-SAVE
                               PIC 99.
           05  R-SAVE          PIC X.

       01  R-SAVE-TABLE.
           05  RESTRICT        OCCURS 31 TIMES.
               10 R-1          PIC X.
               10 R-2          PIC X.
               10 R-PRX        PIC XX.
               10 R-PR         REDEFINES R-PRX
                               PIC 99.
           05  R-TAB           OCCURS 31 TIMES
                               PIC X.

