                   15 SDWK35   PIC XXX.
                   15 SDWK36   PIC XXX.
                   15 SDWK37   PIC XXX.
               10  W3-LEV-R.
                   15 W3-L1    PIC XX.
                   15 W3-R1    PIC X.
                   15 W3-L2    PIC XX.
                   15 W3-R2    PIC X.
                   15 W3-L3    PIC XX.
                   15 W3-R3    PIC X.
                   15 W3-L4    PIC XX.
                   15 W3-R4    PIC X.
                   15 W3-L5    PIC XX.
                   15 W3-R5    PIC X.
                   15 W3-L6    PIC XX.
                   15 W3-R6    PIC X.
                   15 W3-L7    PIC XX.
                   15 W3-R7    PIC X.
           05  SD-WEEK-4.
