                   15 W4-R2    PIC X.
                   15 W4-L3    PIC XX.
                   15 W4-R3    PIC X.
                   15 W4-L4    PIC XX.
                   15 W4-R4    PIC X.
                   15 W4-L5    PIC XX.
                   15 W4-R5    PIC X.
                   15 W4-L6    PIC XX.
                   15 W4-R6    PIC X.
                   15 W4-L7    PIC XX.
                   15 W4-R7    PIC X.
           05  SD-WEEK-5.
               10  SD-WK5.
                   15 SDWK51   PIC XXX.
                   15 SDWK52   PIC XXX.
                   15 SDWK53   PIC XXX.
                   15 SDWK54   PIC XXX.
                   15 SDWK55   PIC XXX.
                   15 SDWK56   PIC XXX.
                   15 SDWK57   PIC XXX.
               10  W5-LEV-R.
                   15 W5-L1    PIC XX.
                   15 W5-R1    PIC X.
